ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_BlackBeltWaiIntro::
	.string "I’m the KARATE KING!\n"
	.string "Your fate rests with me!$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_BlackBeltWaiDefeat::
	.string "Ayah!$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_BlackBeltWai::
	.string "The POKéMON LEAGUE?\n"
	.string "You? Don’t get cocky!$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_LeaderSabrinaIntro::
	.string "Heh!\n"
	.string "You must be running out of steam\l"
	.string "by now!$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_LeaderSabrinaDefeat::
	.string "I ran out of gas!$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_LeaderSabrina::
	.string "You’ll need power to keep up with\n"
	.string "our GYM LEADER.$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_DragonTamerMikahilIntro::
	.string "Rrrroar!\n"
	.string "I’m working myself into a rage!$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_DragonTamerMikahilDefeat::
	.string "Wargh!$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_DragonTamerMikahil::
	.string "I’m still not worthy!$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_TamerJasonIntro::
	.string "POKéMON and I, we make wonderful\n"
	.string "music together!$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_TamerJasonDefeat::
	.string "You are in perfect harmony!$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_TamerJason::
	.string "Do you know the identity of our\n"
	.string "GYM LEADER?$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_YoungsterFabricioIntro::
	.string "Your POKéMON will cower at the\n"
	.string "crack of my whip!$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_YoungsterFabricioDefeat::
	.string "Yowch!\n"
	.string "Whiplash!$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_YoungsterFabricio::
	.string "Wait!\n"
	.string "I was just careless!$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_BlackBeltKiyo2Intro::
	.string "Karate is the ultimate form of\n"
	.string "martial arts!$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_BlackBeltKiyo2Defeat::
	.string "Aiyah!$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_BlackBeltKiyo2::
	.string "If my POKéMON were as good at\n"
	.string "karate as I…$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_RivalTerry4Intro::
	.string "VIRIDIAN GYM was closed for a\n"
	.string "long time.\p"
	.string "But now, our LEADER is back!$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_RivalTerry4Defeat::
	.string "I was beaten?$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_RivalTerry4::
	.string "You can go on to the POKéMON\n"
	.string "LEAGUE only by defeating our GYM\l"
	.string "LEADER!$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_LeaderBlue2Intro::
	.string "BLUE: Yo! Finally got here, huh?\p"
	.string "I wasn’t in the mood as CINNABAR,\n"
	.string "but now I’m ready to battle you.\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "You’re telling me you conquered all\n"
	.string "the GYMS in JOHTO?\p"
	.string "Heh! JOHTO’s GYMS must be pretty\n"
	.string "pathetic then.\p"
	.string "Hey, don’t worry about it.\p"
	.string "I’ll know if you are good or not\n"
	.string "by battling you right now.\p"
	.string "Ready, JOHTO CHAMP?$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_LeaderBlue2Defeat::
	.string "BLUE: What?\n"
	.string "How the heck did I lose to you?\p"
	.string "..\p"
	.string "Tch, all right... here, take this--\n"
	.string "it’s EARTHBADGE.\p"
	.string "{FONT 0x02}{PLAYER} received the EARTHBADGE!{PAUSE_MUSIC}{PLAY_BGM MUS_OBTAIN_BADGE}{PAUSE 0xFE}{PAUSE 0x56}{RESUME_MUSIC}$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_LeaderBlue2_1::
	.string "BLUE: Listen, you.\n"
	.string "You’d better not lose until I beat\l"
	.string "you. Got it?$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_LeaderBlue2_2::
	.string "BLUE: ...\p"
	.string "All right. I was wrong.\n"
	.string "You’re the real deal.\p"
	.string "You are a good trainer.\p"
	.string "But I’m going to beat you someday.\n"
	.string "Don’t you forget it!$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_LeaderErikaIntro::
	.string "The truly talented win with style.$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_LeaderErikaDefeat::
	.string "I lost my grip!$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_LeaderErika::
	.string "The LEADER will scold me for\n"
	.string "losing this way…$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_GymGuy_1::
	.string "Yo, CHAMP in making!\n"
	.string "How’s it going?\p"
	.string "Looks like you’re on a roll.\p"
	.string "The GYM LEADER is a guy who battled\n"
	.string "the CHAMPION three years ago.\p"
	.string "He’s no pushover.\p"
	.string "Give it everything you’ve got!$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_GymGuy_2::
	.string "Man, you are truly tough...\p"
	.string "That was a heck of an inspirational\n"
	.string "battle.\p"
	.string "It brought tears to my eyes.$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_Sign1_1::
	.string "VIRIDIAN POKéMON GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER: BLUE\p"
	.string "WINNING TRAINERS: CARLOS$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_Sign1_2::
	.string "VIRIDIAN POKéMON GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER: BLUE\p"
	.string "WINNING TRAINERS: CARLOS {PLAYER}$"
